      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Is this a new thing or an old thing? The paragraph about textures makes it clear for textures they're making them more compressible. VRChat uses user generated content so those users would need to be operating that particular tool. \n\nIn a large enough instance my download speed is not really a factor for anything. \n\nTheir other product being Bink video doesn't make me feel like their product is really needed in the modern era. \n\nConvincing more people to install av1 support on their windows pc would be a better use of time.",
