  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Why hasn’t VRChat integrated RAD Game Tools’ Oodle compression yet, and are there plans to do so—given that Oodle Network Compression can shrink packet sizes up to 6:1 with virtually no added latency, while Oodle Data and Texture can cut asset load times from tens of seconds to under one, enabling more avatars in a world, faster avatar/world loads, and smoother performance on lower‑end hardware?\n\nhttps://www.radgametools.com/oodle.htm",
